<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38551" root="مسأ" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ الطَّرِيقَ</span></b>  <i>He went along the middle of the
road;</i> (K;) or <i>the hard and elevated part</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَتْن</span>)
<i>of the road.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ</span> <i>He was slow,</i> or
<i>tardy.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ حَقَّهُ</span> <i>He delayed giving
him his due.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ القِدْرَ</span> <i>He stilled,</i>
or <i>allayed, the boiling of the pot.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَهُ بِالقَوْلِ</span> <i>He soothed,</i> or <i>softened, him by
words.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ</span> <i>He beguiled,</i> or <i>deceived.</i>
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b7-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ عَلَى شَىْءٍ</span>, (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْءٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He became accustomed,</i> or <i>inured to a thing.</i>
(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ بَيْنَهُمْ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امسأ</span></b> , <i>He excited
discord between them.</i> (K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَأَ</span>, (S, K,)
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَاَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْءٌ</span> (S, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسُوءٌ</span>, (K,)
<i>He was hard,</i> or <i>impudent, and rude; not caring
for what one said,</i> or <i>did to him.</i> (AZ, S, K.)

